    "To block apps during flights, enable Screen Time access for FocusGlobe in Settings.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "若要在飞行期间屏蔽应用，请在“设置”中为 FocusGlobe 启用“屏幕使用时间”访问权限。"
